# Tests of the `wide` module; generated from tools/wide.dsl by tools/build.py. They run under
# `refined test`, where machine and system targets work in the JIT's own process.

wideTest is test
wideTest purpose "Text goes to UTF-16 and back unchanged, lower case is the invariant locale's with `\\` for `/`, a builder puts text together, and texts are ordered by their bytes"
wideTest verifies widen widensText
wideTest verifies wideUnits countsUnits
wideTest verifies narrow narrowsText
wideTest verifies lowercase lowersText
wideTest verifies builderNew startsEmpty
wideTest verifies builderAdd addsBytes
wideTest verifies builderAddByte addsByte
wideTest verifies builderText givesBytes
wideTest verifies builderLength givesLength
wideTest verifies textOrder ordersText
wideTest typeParameter none
wideTest input none
wideTest output none
wideTest outputOwnedBy none
wideTest raises none
wideTest effect use machine.memory
wideTest effect use system.calls
wideTest uses memoryAccess
wideTest uses systemCalls
wideTest memoryHeap false
wideTest async false
wideTest maxRecursion none
wideTest label begin loopKind none
wideTest label begin within none
wideTest label linuxLower loopKind none
wideTest label linuxLower within none
wideTest label windowsWide loopKind none
wideTest label windowsWide within none
wideTest label builders loopKind none
wideTest label builders within none
wideTest let mixed String "C:/Données/ÉTÉ" immutable
wideTest let lowered String "c:\\données\\été" immutable
wideTest let shorter String "abc" immutable
wideTest let longer String "abd" immutable
wideTest let scratchAt Int64 61440 immutable
wideTest let zero Int64 0 immutable
wideTest let fourteen Int64 14 immutable
wideTest let three Int64 3 immutable
wideTest let byteD Byte 100 immutable
wideTest let four Int64 4 immutable
wideTest let minusOne Int64 -1 immutable
wideTest let one Int64 1 immutable
wideTest at begin do findState
wideTest at begin do findLength
wideTest at begin do findMixed
wideTest at begin do mixedLength
wideTest at begin do osCheck
wideTest at begin branch if onLinux goto linuxLower else goto windowsWide
wideTest at linuxLower do copyIt
wideTest at linuxLower do readCopied
wideTest at linuxLower do expectCopiedLength
wideTest at linuxLower do compareCopied
wideTest at linuxLower do sameCopiedWide
wideTest at linuxLower do expectCopied
wideTest at linuxLower do giveCopied
wideTest at linuxLower goto builders
wideTest at windowsWide do wideIt
wideTest at windowsWide do countIt
wideTest at windowsWide do expectUnits
wideTest at windowsWide do backIt
wideTest at windowsWide do readBack
wideTest at windowsWide do expectBackLength
wideTest at windowsWide do compareBack
wideTest at windowsWide do sameWide
wideTest at windowsWide do expectBack
wideTest at windowsWide do lowerIt
wideTest at windowsWide do readLower
wideTest at windowsWide do findLowered
wideTest at windowsWide do loweredLength
wideTest at windowsWide do expectLowerLength
wideTest at windowsWide do compareLower
wideTest at windowsWide do sameLowerWide
wideTest at windowsWide do expectLower
wideTest at windowsWide do giveWide
wideTest at windowsWide do giveBack
wideTest at windowsWide do giveLower
wideTest at windowsWide goto builders
wideTest at builders do makeBuilder
wideTest at builders do readEmpty
wideTest at builders do expectEmpty
wideTest at builders do findShorter
wideTest at builders do addShorter
wideTest at builders do addByte
wideTest at builders do readBuilt
wideTest at builders do expectBuilt
wideTest at builders do readBuiltText
wideTest at builders do findLonger
wideTest at builders do orderBuilt
wideTest at builders do expectBuiltOrder
wideTest at builders do orderLess
wideTest at builders do expectLess
wideTest at builders do orderPrefix
wideTest at builders do expectPrefix
wideTest at builders return ok none

